---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'What is the EMBL PhD Symposium?',
    a: 'The EMBL PhD Symposium is organised by EMBL PhD students to provide an opportunity for networking between early-career researchers and high-profile scientists. This year\'s theme is <strong>Shifting gears: automation, AI, and high-throughput methodologies</strong>.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What is the Symposium about?',
    a: 'The 28th EMBL PhD Symposium focuses on how high-throughput technologies, automation, quantitative analysis, and interdisciplinary approaches are accelerating biological science. Through talks, poster sessions, workshops, and networking activities, it brings together researchers across disciplines to explore how collaborative and technology-driven science can address major challenges in human health, sustainability, and the future of our world.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Who can attend the symposium?',
    a: 'The symposium is primarily directed towards PhD students and undergraduates, but everybody is welcome to participate.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How do I register?',
    a: 'Register via <a href="https://embl.ungerboeck.com/PROD/emc00/register.aspx?aat=3532786b714233776141585163793455734f654f74696e367936556f57664e4d516e744135536d7372546b3d" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-green-700 underline-animate hover:text-green-500 transition-colors">on-site registration</a> or <a href="https://embl.ungerboeck.com/PROD/emc00/register.aspx?aat=43657545326f35693631452b686830594d6b512b2f75534a46724653322b316e796a58665a3548656773343d" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-green-700 underline-animate hover:text-green-500 transition-colors">virtual registration</a>. EMBL-affiliated participants have a dedicated link in the Registration & fees section above. For questions, email <a href="mailto:phdsymposium2026.participants@embl.de" class="text-green-700 underline-animate hover:text-green-500 transition-colors">phdsymposium2026.participants@embl.de</a>.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How much does it cost?',
    a: 'See the Registration &amp; Fees table above for the full price breakdown. On-site fees include catering (coffee breaks, lunch, and dinner) and networking events. Remote fees include virtual access to all speaker sessions and student talks. Accommodation is not included.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I submit an abstract without paying immediately?',
    a: 'Yes — during registration, select the "I will pay later" option. Payment must be received before <strong>August 10th, 2026</strong> for the early bird discount, and before <strong>October 21st, 2026</strong> for the regular rate.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How and when can I get the early bird fee?',
    a: 'The early bird fee applies to on-site participants who <strong>register and pay</strong> before <strong>August 10th, 2026</strong>. If payment is not received by then, the regular fee applies.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What are the registration deadlines?',
    a: '<ul class="mt-1 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside"><li>Early bird: <strong>August 10th, 2026</strong></li><li>Regular: <strong>October 21st, 2026</strong></li><li>Virtual: <strong>November 25th, 2026</strong></li></ul>Registration is completed only once payment is received.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I submit an abstract for a talk or poster if my topic is not fully on-theme?',
    a: 'Yes. Abstracts are welcome from all participants regardless of topic; however, studies closely aligned with the symposium theme will be preferred during selection.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is there a deadline for abstract submission?',
    a: 'Abstracts for talks and/or posters can be submitted until <strong>August 26th, 2026</strong>.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How do I submit an abstract?',
    a: 'Abstracts can only be submitted after registering as an on-site participant. The submission link is provided in the registration confirmation email.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do I need to submit an abstract to attend?',
    a: 'No — abstract submission is not required. However, we strongly encourage every participant to submit one.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is it possible to participate remotely?',
    a: 'Yes, virtual participation will be available. We encourage in-person attendance to fully experience the networking opportunities the symposium provides.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What is included in remote participation?',
    a: 'Remote participants have access to all live-streamed talks and can submit questions during the event. Recorded talks are also available during the symposium and for four weeks afterwards, subject to individual speaker consent.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I give a talk or present a poster when participating remotely?',
    a: 'No — only on-site participants can submit abstracts, present posters, or give a talk.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is there a symposium shuttle bus?',
    a: 'Yes, there will be a shuttle bus service. The schedule and pick-up/drop-off point in Heidelberg city centre will be announced here closer to the event.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Are there travel grants available?',
    a: 'Yes. Travel grants include a registration fee waiver and travel cost coverage of up to <strong>€1,000 for international participants</strong> and up to <strong>€400 for EU participants</strong>. Apply when submitting your abstract — financial support applications do not affect your registration outcome. See the <a href="https://www.embl.org/about/info/course-and-conference-office/information-for-participants/financial-assistance/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-green-700 underline-animate hover:text-green-500 transition-colors">EMBL financial assistance page</a> for details.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I get a visa support letter?',
    a: 'We can issue a registration confirmation to support your visa procedure (this is not an official invitation letter). The confirmation is provided upon request after payment. We recommend booking your visa appointment as soon as possible. If your visa application is unsuccessful, your registration fee will be reimbursed upon proof.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What is the cancellation policy?',
    a: 'Please refer to the <a href="https://www.embl.org/about/info/course-and-conference-office/information-for-participants/terms-and-conditions/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-green-700 underline-animate hover:text-green-500 transition-colors">EMBL General Terms and Conditions</a>. For urgent cases, contact <a href="mailto:phdsymposium2026.participants@embl.de" class="text-green-700 underline-animate hover:text-green-500 transition-colors">phdsymposium2026.participants@embl.de</a>.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What if I have specific accessibility needs?',
    a: 'We are committed to inclusivity. If you have specific accessibility needs, please contact us at <a href="mailto:phdsymposium2026.participants@embl.de" class="text-green-700 underline-animate hover:text-green-500 transition-colors">phdsymposium2026.participants@embl.de</a> and we will do our best to accommodate you.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How can I contact the organisers?',
    a: 'For any general inquiries, reach out to <a href="mailto:phdsymposium2026.participants@embl.de" class="text-green-700 underline-animate hover:text-green-500 transition-colors">phdsymposium2026.participants@embl.de</a>.',
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — 28th EMBL PhD Symposium 2026"
  description="About the 28th EMBL PhD Symposium: venue, travel information, accommodation, and practical details for attending."
>
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <div class="relative bg-green-900 pt-32 pb-20 overflow-hidden">
    <img
      src={`${base}gear1.svg`}
      alt=""
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="absolute -top-16 -left-20 w-125 gear-spin-slow pointer-events-none select-none"
      style="filter: invert(1) opacity(0.05);"
    />
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <div class="h-px w-10 bg-green-500"></div>
        <span class="label-tag text-green-400">Symposium Information</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-display font-800 text-white text-5xl lg:text-7xl mb-4">About</h1>
      <p class="font-body text-white/60 text-lg max-w-2xl">
        Everything you need to know to attend the 28th EMBL PhD Symposium — from the history of the event
        to practical travel and accommodation information.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24">

    <!-- About the symposium -->
    <section class="mb-20 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="h-px w-10 bg-red-600"></div>
          <span class="label-tag text-red-600">The Symposium</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-800 text-ink text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-6">
          28 years of EMBL PhD symposia
        </h2>
        <div class="font-body text-muted text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>
            The EMBL PhD Symposium is an annual conference entirely organised by PhD students
            at the European Molecular Biology Laboratory. Since its inception in 1999, it has
            become one of the premier scientific meetings for early-career researchers in the life sciences.
          </p>
          <p>
            Each year, the organising committee — composed of current EMBL PhD students — selects a theme,
            invites world-leading speakers, curates the scientific programme, and manages all logistics.
            The result is a scientifically rigorous yet deeply personal gathering that reflects the
            values and curiosity of the next generation of scientists.
          </p>
          <p>
            The 28th edition, themed <strong>"Shifting gears: automation, AI, and high-throughput methodologies,"</strong> explores
            how automation, scalable experimental design, and artificial intelligence are accelerating scientific
            discovery — enhancing reliability and reproducibility while bridging the gap between fundamental
            biological questions and biomedical breakthroughs. From robotic wet-lab workflows to AI-driven
            data analysis, the programme spans the full spectrum from foundational academic research to
            industry-scale implementation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick facts sidebar -->
      <div class="space-y-0">
        <div class="bg-green-900 text-white p-8">
          <h3 class="font-display font-700 text-xl mb-6 text-green-400">Quick facts</h3>
          {[
            { label: 'Edition',    value: '28th (2026)'             },
            { label: 'Theme',      value: 'Shifting gears: automation, AI, and high-throughput methodologies' },
            { label: 'Dates',      value: 'December 2–4, 2026'     },
            { label: 'Venue',      value: 'EMBL Heidelberg, ATC Auditorium' },
            { label: 'Capacity',   value: '~100 participants'       },
            { label: 'Organised',  value: 'EMBL PhD Students Association' },
          ].map(({ label, value }) => (
            <div class="fact-row">
              <span class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-green-400/60">{label}</span>
              <span class="font-body text-sm text-white/80">{value}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Venue section -->
    <section id="venue" class="mb-20 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
        <div class="h-px w-10 bg-red-600"></div>
        <span class="label-tag text-red-600">Venue</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display font-800 text-ink text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-10">EMBL Heidelberg</h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <div class="venue-block">
            <h3 class="font-display font-700 text-lg text-ink mb-2">ATC Auditorium</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-muted leading-relaxed">
              The Advanced Training Centre (ATC) Auditorium is EMBL's state-of-the-art conference facility,
              seating 500 and equipped with high-definition projection systems, conference audio, and
              simultaneous translation booths. The adjacent foyer and corridors serve as poster exhibition space.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <iframe
          src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2578.6!2d8.7068172!3d49.3841888!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x4797c05e3b8ea0cb%3A0x9292a95c649c8475!2sEMBL%20Advanced%20Training%20Centre%20(ATC)!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sde!4v1"
          class="w-full h-56 border-0 grayscale"
          allowfullscreen
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          title="EMBL Advanced Training Centre map"
        ></iframe>
        <a
          href="https://www.embl.org/about/info/course-and-conference-office/information-for-participants/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="font-display font-700 text-sm text-green-700 underline-animate hover:text-green-500 transition-colors"
        >
          EMBL participant information →
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Travel section -->
    <section id="travel" class="mb-20 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
        <div class="h-px w-10 bg-red-600"></div>
        <span class="label-tag text-red-600">Getting Here</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display font-800 text-ink text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-10">Travel information</h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
        {[
          {
            icon: '✈️',
            title: 'By Air',
            content: 'Frankfurt Airport (FRA) is the closest and most convenient airport — 82 km from Heidelberg. Stuttgart (STR, 120 km) is a secondary option. Direct airport shuttles and transfer taxis serve Heidelberg.',
          },
          {
            icon: '🚆',
            title: 'By Train',
            content: 'Heidelberg Hauptbahnhof has extensive European connections. EMBL collaborates with Deutsche Bahn for discounted tickets — contact <a href="mailto:events@embl.de" class="text-green-700 underline-animate hover:text-green-500 transition-colors">events@embl.de</a> for details.',
          },
          {
            icon: '🚌',
            title: 'City Centre to EMBL',
            content: 'Bus 28 (direction Mombertplatz) stops directly at EMBL. Bus 39 (direction Königstuhl) stops at MPI Kernphysik — 5-minute walk. Taxi from the station costs ~€20. Note: Sunday and holiday services are limited.',
          },
        ].map(({ icon, title, content }) => (
          <div class="travel-card">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-4">{icon}</div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-700 text-ink text-xl mb-3">{title}</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-muted leading-relaxed" set:html={content} />
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <a
        href="https://www.embl.org/about/info/course-and-conference-office/information-for-participants/travel-information/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="font-display font-700 text-sm text-green-700 underline-animate hover:text-green-500 transition-colors"
      >
        Full travel information on the EMBL website →
      </a>
    </section>

    <!-- Accommodation section -->
    <section id="accommodation" class="mb-20 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
        <div class="h-px w-10 bg-red-600"></div>
        <span class="label-tag text-red-600">Where to Stay</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display font-800 text-ink text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-10">Accommodation</h2>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <!-- Official EMBL partner accommodation -->
        <div class="accommodation-card accommodation-card-highlight">
          <h3 class="font-display font-700 text-ink text-lg mb-2">Official EMBL partner accommodation</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            EMBL's official partner accommodation option for visitors is <strong>Hotel ISG</strong>.
            Full details and booking information are available on the EMBL accommodation page.
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://www.embl.org/sites/heidelberg/accommodation/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="font-display font-700 text-sm text-green-700 underline-animate hover:text-green-500 transition-colors"
          >
            EMBL Accommodation Page →
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Alternative accommodation -->
        <div class="accommodation-card">
          <h3 class="font-display font-700 text-ink text-lg mb-2">Recommended hotels</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A range of hotels and aparthotels are available in Heidelberg city centre:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            {[
              { name: 'B&B Hotel Heidelberg',                    url: 'https://www.hotel-bb.com/de/hotel/heidelberg' },
              { name: 'Ibis Heidelberg Hauptbahnhof',            url: 'https://all.accor.com/hotel/1447/index.en.shtml' },
              { name: 'Staycity Aparthotel',                     url: 'https://www.staycity.com/de-de/heidelberg' },
              { name: 'Meininger Hotel Heidelberg Hauptbahnhof', url: 'https://www.meininger-hotels.com/de/hotels/heidelberg/hotel-heidelberg-hauptbahnhof' },
              { name: 'Leonardo Hotel Heidelberg City Center',   url: 'https://www.leonardo-hotels.com/heidelberg/leonardo-hotel-heidelberg-city-center' },
              { name: 'Premier Inn Heidelberg City Zentrum',     url: 'https://www.premierinn.com/de/de/hotels/deutschland/baden-wuerttemberg/heidelberg/heidelberg-city-zentrum.html' },
            ].map(({ name, url }) => (
              <li>
                <a
                  href={url}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="font-display font-700 text-sm text-green-700 underline-animate hover:text-green-500 transition-colors"
                >
                  {name} →
                </a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Registration & fees -->
    <section id="registration" class="mb-20 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
        <div class="h-px w-10 bg-red-600"></div>
        <span class="label-tag text-red-600">Registration</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display font-800 text-ink text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-10">Registration & fees</h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6">
        <table class="reg-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th></th>
              <th>Early Bird<span>until Aug 10</span></th>
              <th>Regular</th>
              <th>Virtual</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Bachelor / Master student</td>
              <td>225 €</td>
              <td>260 €</td>
              <td>70 €</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>PhD student</td>
              <td>310 €</td>
              <td>410 €</td>
              <td>70 €</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>EMBL-affiliated</td>
              <td>—</td>
              <td>240 €</td>
              <td>70 €</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Academia</td>
              <td>420 €</td>
              <td>510 €</td>
              <td>70 €</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Industry</td>
              <td>—</td>
              <td>720 €</td>
              <td>120 €</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-1 mb-8">
        <p class="font-body text-sm text-muted">EMBL predoctoral fellows attend free of charge.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-5">
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-muted mb-2">On-site</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="https://embl.ungerboeck.com/PROD/emc00/register.aspx?aat=3532786b714233776141585163793455734f654f74696e367936556f57664e4d516e744135536d7372546b3d" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-display font-700 text-sm px-6 py-3 bg-red-600 text-white hover:bg-red-700 transition-colors">Standard</a>
            <a href="https://embl.ungerboeck.com/PROD/emc00/register.aspx?aat=716d4d6a4e676f6932323267614d42736b796b6c6f536b454d503669763449717575504642757a6b48726f3d" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-display font-700 text-sm px-6 py-3 border border-ink/20 text-ink hover:bg-ink/5 transition-colors">EMBL-affiliated</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-muted mb-2">Virtual</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="https://embl.ungerboeck.com/PROD/emc00/register.aspx?aat=43657545326f35693631452b686830594d6b512b2f75534a46724653322b316e796a58665a3548656773343d" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-display font-700 text-sm px-6 py-3 bg-red-600 text-white hover:bg-red-700 transition-colors">Standard</a>
            <a href="https://embl.ungerboeck.com/PROD/emc00/register.aspx?aat=6b43594953694d6b613539313869736b454449474f67444e714c306e5a59724668516e35504b66336d4f383d" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-display font-700 text-sm px-6 py-3 border border-ink/20 text-ink hover:bg-ink/5 transition-colors">EMBL-affiliated</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section id="faq" class="mb-20 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
        <div class="h-px w-10 bg-red-600"></div>
        <span class="label-tag text-red-600">FAQ</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display font-800 text-ink text-3xl lg:text-4xl mb-10">Frequently asked questions</h2>

      <div class="space-y-0 border border-warm">
        {faqs.map(({ q, a }) => (
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary class="faq-question">
              <span>{q}</span>
              <svg class="faq-arrow w-5 h-5 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="font-body text-muted leading-relaxed" set:html={a} />
            </div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Code of Conduct -->
    <section id="code-of-conduct" class="mb-20 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="bg-green-900 border border-green-700 p-8 lg:p-12">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="h-px w-8 bg-green-500"></div>
          <span class="label-tag text-green-400">Our Commitment</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-800 text-ink text-2xl lg:text-3xl mb-4" id="code-of-conduct-title">
          Code of conduct
        </h2>
        <p class="font-body text-green-100 leading-relaxed">
          We are committed to creating a welcoming, inclusive, and scientifically stimulating environment
          for all participants. Harassment, discrimination, or exclusionary behaviour of any kind will not
          be tolerated. Any concerns should be reported to the symposium committee
          via <a href="mailto:phdsymposium2026.participants@embl.de" class="text-green-400 underline-animate hover:text-green-300">phdsymposium2026.participants@embl.de</a>.
          All reports are treated with full confidentiality.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .fact-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .fact-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .venue-block {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-cream);
    height: 100%;
  }

  .travel-card {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-cream);
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .travel-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-green-500);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px var(--color-cyan-glow-sm);
  }

  .accommodation-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-cream);
    margin-bottom: -1px;
  }
  .accommodation-card-highlight {
    border-color: var(--color-green-500);
    background: var(--color-green-900);
    position: relative;
  }
  .accommodation-card-highlight::before {
    content: 'Recommended';
    position: absolute;
    top: 1rem;
    right: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-green-500);
